        <mxCell id="exec_icon_run" value="" style="editableCssRules=.*;html=1;shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000000;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="736" y="492" width="18" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;STANDARD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Shared: the OP process, and the Runtime Job definition with its Service Account. Not shared: the execution or the identity - 1 Agent = 1 Execution at either level.&lt;br&gt;Cloud Run IAM binds sa-agent-runtime to shared-agent-op, so Layer 1 is identical for every STANDARD Agent. Layer 2, the Agent Client Credential, tells them apart.&lt;br&gt;Blast radius: a compromised Shared OP reaches the signing key, and the Registration and Refresh Token of every STANDARD Agent.&lt;br&gt;Dashed: created only when enable_google_bridge=true." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
